eal-time visibility into daily income statements sorted by operational shifts.<br />\r\n* Daily Income Statements: Comprehensive end-of-day financial summaries and reporting.<br />\r\n* E-Hundi &amp; UPI Integration: Digital collection facility for Hundi (Kanikka) and Vazhipadu payments using UPI/QR codes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>B. Web &amp; Infrastructure Inclusions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Official Temple Website: A dedicated public portal showcasing temple history, timings, festivals, and notifications.<br />\r\n* Cloud Server Space: High-speed, secure hosting infrastructure to run both the website and management software seamlessly.<br />\r\n* Domain Name Registration: Registration of a custom domain name (e.g., yourtemplename.com).<br />\r\n* SSL Certificate Security: Secure Sockets Layer (SSL) encryption to ensure &quot;HTTPS&quot; security, protecting sensitive data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong>&nbsp;2. Financial Estimate (Itemized Split</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Cloud Software License &amp; Implementation (Vazhipadu registration, advanced booking, reports, user control) - â‚¹ 30,000/- 2. Official Website Development (Public portal, history, notifications, temple gallery) - â‚¹ 12,000/-&nbsp;<br />\r\n3. Cloud Server Space (1 Year Validity) (High-speed secure hosting for software &amp; website) - â‚¹ 6,000/-&nbsp;<br />\r\n4. Domain Name Registration (1 Year Validity) (Custom web address registration) -&nbsp; â‚¹ 1,900/-&nbsp;<br />\r\n5. SSL Certificate Security (1 Year Validity) (HTTPS secure encryption setup) - â‚¹ 3500/-&nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; TOTAL PACKAGE COST =&nbsp;&nbsp;â‚¹ 53,400/-&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. SMS Gateway Charges</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Complimentary Offer: 1,000 free SMS credited at the time of initial software implementation.<br />\r\n* Standard Tariff: Post-complimentary usage will be charged at 19 Paisa per SMS.</p>\r\n','',0,'TELECALL','INR','','Sandra','Sandra',1,0,0,'','0000-00-00','','','','','','','','2026-06-27 15:23:16','2026-06-27 16:09:29',NULL,0,''),(72,'QTN382202072026B',3822,73000,'<p><strong>PROPOSAL FOR WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT &amp; ONLINE VAZHIPADU BOOKING SYSTEM</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for giving us the opportunity to submit this proposal for your website development and online booking system. Based on your requirements, we have prepared the following scope and costing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Website Designing and Hosting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scope of Work:<br />\r\n- Static Website Design with modern and responsive layout<br />\r\n- New Home Page Design with 2D jQuery based scripting using JavaScript<br />\r\n- Technologies: HTML, CSS, XML integration<br />\r\n- Mobile Responsive Design - Optimized for all devices<br />\r\n- Google Map Integration using Geolocation API<br />\r\n- Static/Dynamic Page Design as per requirements<br />\r\n- Standard Links: About, Contact, Gallery, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Investment: â‚¹25,000</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Online Vazhipadu Booking System</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Modules Included:<br />\r\n- Devotee Registration - User signup and profile management<br />\r\n- Vazhipadu Details with Tariff - Complete list with rates<br />\r\n- Prathishta Details - Deity wise information management<br />\r\n- Pooja Booking by Prathishta Wise - Select deity and book poojas<br />\r\n- Daily Booking Statements - Prathishta and Pooja wise reports<br />\r\n- Daily Income Statements - Cash and Bank transaction reports</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Investment: â‚¹48,000</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Total Project Cost: â‚¹73,000</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','',0,'Telecalling','INR','','SANDRA . GEORGE','SANDRA . GEORGE',1,0,0,'','0000-00-00','','','','','','','','2026-07-02 15:41:44','2026-07-02 16:13:03',NULL,0,''),(73,'QTN403106072026A',4031,18000,'<p>DETAILED SCOPE OF WORK:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Page Architecture (Up to 5 Pages)<br />\r\n&bull;<strong> Home Page</strong>: Premium 