Optimization</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Monthly Charge: â‚¹5,000</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Terms &amp; Conditions &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nSupport: Full support will be provided to you via Internet, Email, Phone to start running of existing website. (not related Data) Product License: &nbsp;Installation in one server only. &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nDelivery: Within 20 days from the Order Date &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nPayment: &nbsp;75% advance should be made on signing of contract and balance 25% will be 1st demo of the software. &nbsp;All the payments should be done through Demand draft or Cheque payable to &ldquo;PROGRAMERS &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nInternational, Thrissur. &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nRenewal Of Server space/hosting: In addition to the AMC, yearly domain and database, server space renewal amount to be paid in Advance., 1 GB dedicated Server Space high speed c3 Server with Limited Bandwidth (Approximately 250MB), Database &ndash; MySQL- excluding the tax) The charges for server space will be started on the day of registration of the domain, irrespective of the site hosting date. The renewal charges for the website includes domain renewal and server space charges is to be paid 30 days before expiry date of the domain. The rates for domain renewal and server space may change if ICANN makes a change in their charges or as per the change in Currency rates of Indian Rupees with US Dollars. &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nTaxes and Duties: &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nThe total price for the contract does not include any taxes or other fees payable to the government. If the government in the future levies any tax, fee or other outgoings, the same shall have to be borne by the client.&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nI accepted the order amount, and terms &amp;conditions &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;I accepted the order amount, and terms &amp; conditions &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n1st Party &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nThe Managing Director&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nNambeesans Lakshmi Lodge, Thriprayar, Thrissur.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2nd Party &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nHusna M S<br /><br />\r\nPROGRAMERS, Rd North, Thrissur &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nMob. 9495951442, 9446451442 &nbsp;</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>To, &nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 19th June 2026&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nThe Managing Director&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nNambeesans Lakshmi Lodge, Thriprayar, Thrissur<br /><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nSub: - Website Redesign Quotation Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Domain + Server + SSL Cost &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Domian And Server Registration for one year Cost: Already registered&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nSSL Certificate Cost INR 3500: NA</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Website Development &ndash; Static</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>We propose to design and develop a professional, mobile-friendly website for Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge.</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Features Included:</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>* Home Page<br /><br />\r\n* About Us<br /><br />\r\n* Facilities<br /><br />\r\n* Gallery<br /><br />\r\n* Tarrif<br /><br />\r\n* Restaurants&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\n* Contact Page</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Restaurant page/section will be developed as a Dynamic page for easy image updates.</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Pricing</p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><p>Website Development: â‚¹20,000 &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />\r\nDiscount &nbsp; &nbsp